
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#   ≤ 72 chars · imperative ("add", not "added") · lowercase · no full stop
#
# Why the change is needed: the problem, requirement or context.
# (Required for feat and fix. Wrap at 72 characters.)
#
# - What changed, one bullet per notable change
# - Anything teammates must do: "New env var REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET"
#
# Refs: #12
# Co-authored-by: Name <email>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <only if an API or the schema changes incompatibly>
#
# types   feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scopes  listed in .githooks/scopes
#
# Full rules: CONTRIBUTING.md §3. Lines starting with # are ignored.
